Subject: Re: Range Shifts and Boundaries
Message-ID: <dXbBLJ4uomc.SULBH5czBgAJ@ctmm-user.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <dXbBLJ4uomc.4veruHPiBQAJ@ctmm-user.groups.google.com>
References: <dXbBLJ4uomc.4veruHPiBQAJ@ctmm-user.groups.google.com>
